<title>CANADA: Algonquin Mercantile bids for Durkin.</title>
<headline>Algonquin Mercantile bids for Durkin.</headline>
<dateline>BURLINGTON, Ontario 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Durkin Hayes Publishing Ltd said it received a takeover bid and circular from Algonquin Mercantile Corp dated April 21.</p>
<p>Durkin's board of directors, which had not had time to review the circular, said it urged shareholders not to tender shares to Algonquin until further communication.</p>
<p>((Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8109))</p>
</text>
